  "details": "So, I was using the creator companion and I ported my world onto the companion. It turned out that it didn't come with a VRC Url Input Field script asset. Was this an intentional change or is this a bug with the current SDK package? I require these assets with one of my prefabs and it causes a lot of issues without it\nEdit: I found out what happened. The script failed to load into the prefab asset. How I fixed it was by doing the following:\n1) I clicked on VRChat SDK > Reload SDK and reloaded the SDK.\n2) I then went to Utilities > Re-compile All Program Sources and re-compiled my assets.\nAnd that was it! It fixed the issues I had.",
